attribution: Traditional American blues ballad, sung in New Orleans and the South by the 1900s; melody and words are stanzas 1 and 2 as printed in Carl Sandburg's The American Songbag (1927) from R. W. Gordon's collection. Public domain: traditional, published before 1931 (United States) and no individual author (Canada).
